GCC 14.2.0 (Debian 14.2.0-19), libgcc/soft-fp/. Objects from libgcc.a linked
into mudi-imsd: addtf3, subtf3, multf3, eqtf2, extenddftf2, fixtfsi,
fixunstfsi, floatsitf, floatunsitf. All nine source files carry the same
license header, quoted verbatim from libgcc/soft-fp/addtf3.c:

