   You should have received a copy of the GNU Lesser General Public
   License along with the GNU C Library; if not, see
   <https://www.gnu.org/licenses/>.

The aarch64 glue they include (libgcc/config/aarch64/sfp-machine.h) is
GPL-3.0-or-later with the GCC Runtime Library Exception 3.1, see COPYING3
and COPYING.RUNTIME in this directory.
